    "detailed_description": "Join the experiment! Imitation is a brain-teasing guessing game. Based on Alan Turing\u2019s theoretical game, it pits humans against AI. Using a range of questions with answers from multiple humans and Large Language Model algorithms, players must choose if the given answer was provided by a human or generated by an AI. But here is the catch, the Artificial Intelligence has been given the parameter to imitate human answers.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFor example:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nQuestion: Why do you enjoy music?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnswer: I enjoy music because it moves me emotionally, helps me relax, and connects me to memories and moments in a way nothing else can.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWas the answer given by a human or an AI?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith over 150 question/answers, players' minds will be tested. Will the Artificial Intelligence fool you? Or are you witty enough to tell the difference between human and machine?",
    "about_the_game": "Join the experiment! Imitation is a brain-teasing guessing game. Based on Alan Turing\u2019s theoretical game, it pits humans against AI. Using a range of questions with answers from multiple humans and Large Language Model algorithms, players must choose if the given answer was provided by a human or generated by an AI. But here is the catch, the Artificial Intelligence has been given the parameter to imitate human answers.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFor example:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nQuestion: Why do you enjoy music?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnswer: I enjoy music because it moves me emotionally, helps me relax, and connects me to memories and moments in a way nothing else can.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWas the answer given by a human or an AI?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith over 150 question/answers, players' minds will be tested. Will the Artificial Intelligence fool you? Or are you witty enough to tell the difference between human and machine?",
    "short_description": "Join the experiment! Imitation is a brain-teasing guessing game. It pits humans against AI. Given a set of questions, players must choose if the answer was provided by a human or generated by an AI. Can you tell the difference between human and AI?",
